msgid "**Bundled Elasticsearch:** Search engine ships with the role until a central ``svc-db-elasticsearch`` exists."
msgstr "**Conjuntos Elasticsearch:** Naves de motor de busca com o papel até uma central ``svc-db-elasticsearch`` existe."

