# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Admission is not declared here. A client marks itself once, in its own ``meta/services.yml`` self-entry, as ``mcp_consumer: true``; a provider deviates by carrying ``mcp_consumer: false`` on that client's entry in its own ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` resolves the pair."
msgstr "A admissão não é declarada aqui. Um cliente marca-se uma vez, no seu próprio ``meta/services.yml`` auto-entrada, como ``mcp_consumer: true``; um prestador desvia-se transportando ``mcp_consumer: false`` na entrada desse cliente em seu próprio ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` resolve o par."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Admission lives in `meta/services.yml`, not here. A client sets `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` in its own role; a provider refuses one by setting `mcp_consumer: false` on that client's entry. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) requires every provider to carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated entry for every declared client, so a round plans provider and client together."
msgstr "A admissão vive em `meta/services.yml`, Aqui não. Um cliente define `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` no seu próprio papel; um prestador recusa-se `mcp_consumer: false` na entrada do cliente. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) exige que cada prestador carregue uma `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-entrada para cada cliente declarado, então um provedor de planos redondos e cliente juntos."

