# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked. ``meta/services.yml`` pins ``sso.enabled: false`` and ``logout.enabled: false``: Bridgy Fed has no local user table, no in-app authorisation tier, and no logout button, and placing it behind the SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic."
