# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Sondas de serviço cruzado (biber negada em prometheus, biber negada em matomo, telha do painel de alcance) NÃO fazem parte da persona biber persona per-role. Eles vivem na própria especificação do fornecedor (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parametrizado uma vez sobre o provedor `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifesto. Para o painel, o cenário parametrizado `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, que possui a visibilidade da telha / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" asserções pop-out em um SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "As sondas de serviço cruzado NÃO fazem parte da persona de administrador per-role. A acessibilidade da telha do painel pertence a `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, que delega o organismo por alvo ao `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (azulejo visível → clique carrega em `#main iframe` → cabeçalho \"Tab\" o botão mostra a incorporação numa nova página do navegador). Esse ajudante é o SPOT para a mecânica do painel-tile; especificações do consumidor NÃO DEVE reimplementar nenhuma dessas afirmações. Prometheus administração-alcançar e paridade de raspagem são de propriedade de `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-aching e presença rastreador são de propriedade de `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Cada provedor parametriza a assertiva sobre sua `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifesto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
