msgstr "Reescrever `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` para usar os fluxos genéricos de admin/biber persona (remover `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED=true` de `templates/playwright.env.j2`, largue o acordo `loginViaOauth2ProxyAndFriendica` helper, solte o FRIENDICA_BASE_URL env var)."

