msgstr "A viagem em si não é abandonada. ```files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`` <./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js>`__ drives it through Shopware’s own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. ``SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED`` selects how it signs in — through the ``a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button`` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into ``.sw-login__content`` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The ``guest`` As afirmações da persona e da capacidade de alcance local, TLS e HSTS são executadas incondicionalmente."

