# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "Este papel instala o `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ pacote e implementa um arquivo sudoers padrão para garantir uma escalada de privilégios segura e consistente no sistema alvo. Ele usa um arquivo de sudoers pré-configurados que segue as melhores práticas e inclui diretrizes para ler arquivos drop-in de ``/etc/sudoers.d``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Este papel instala o script de backup e o serviço systemd que o dirige no cronograma configurado (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), e serializa a corrida contra o resto do grupo de manipulação via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). O caminho de origem é a base de exportação NFS resolvida a partir da [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) serviços SPOT; implantar o papel no host que serve a exportação. Lançar [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) para manter a árvore de instantâneo delimitada e [user-backup](../user-backup/) para que os hospedeiros possam puxar a árvore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Este papel instala o script de backup e o serviço systemd que o dirige no cronograma configurado (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), e serializa a corrida contra o resto do grupo de manipulação via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. O caminho de origem é a base de exportação NFS resolvida a partir da `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ serviços SPOT; implantar o papel no host que serve a exportação. Lançar `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ para manter a árvore de instantâneo delimitada e `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ para que os hospedeiros possam puxar a árvore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Esta função instala os pacotes cliente NFS distro-apropriados em cada máquina do grupo Ansível ``svc-swarm-node`` e a sonda- monta o configurado ``storage.nfs.server`` e a base de exportação da svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT para confirmar alcance e escrita no momento da implantação. As montagens reais do volume do docker acontecem mais tarde, conduzido pelo motor Docker no início do recipiente."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Esta função instala os pacotes cliente NFS distro-apropriados em cada máquina do grupo Ansível `svc-swarm-node` e a sonda- monta o configurado `storage.nfs.server` e a base de exportação da svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT para confirmar alcance e escrita no momento da implantação. As montagens reais do volume do docker acontecem mais tarde, conduzido pelo motor Docker no início do recipiente."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Este papel é um instalador genérico de extensão GNOME conduzido por ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3- lista completa (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumido por ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. Não envia extensões concretas próprias e não lê ``meta/addons/`` Arquivos. Funções que enviam extensões GNOME de concreto, tais como `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declará-los através do contrato de addon unificado sob ``meta/addons/`` (requisito 026), com um arquivo por extensão (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); veja esse papel para o exemplo por arquivo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
