# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS (Your Own URL Shortener) is an open‑source URL shortening solution that enables you to create, track, and manage short links with ease. This deployment leverages Docker to provide a secure and easily scalable environment, ensuring that your YOURLS instance is configured for optimal performance and reliability."
msgstr "AVES (Seu próprio encurtador de URL) é uma solução de encurtamento de URL de código aberto que permite criar, rastrear e gerenciar links curtos com facilidade. Esta implantação aproveita a Docker para fornecer um ambiente seguro e facilmente escalável, garantindo que YOURLS a instância é configurada para desempenho e confiabilidade ideais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "O YOULS não tem SSO nativo; a sessão de administração é cunhada do oauth2- cabeçalho identidade proxy pelo ``shunt_is_valid_user`` Ingresso ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona permanece ao vivo e exerce a ponte ponta a ponta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "O YOULS não tem SSO nativo; a sessão de administração é cunhada do oauth2- cabeçalho identidade proxy pelo `shunt_is_valid_user` Ingresso [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), que honra o cabeçalho apenas no caminho de administração fechado e apenas para os membros do YOURLS grupo administrador. O portão em si admite apenas o mesmo grupo RBAC ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), então `biber` é rejeitado antes YOURLS renderiza qualquer coisa: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declara `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, e a negação é afirmada explicitamente por `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. `administrator` persona permanece ao vivo e exerce a ponte ponta a ponta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
