# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabbed `mod_admin` UI HTTP é a única superfície testável por Playwright; o login do cliente XMPP em si é executado 5222/5269 e DEVE ser exercido por um XMPP-Conhece o cliente fora do circuito de testes da Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "A única superfície HTTP do ejabberd é `ejabberd_web_admin` ligado `/admin` (ver [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Ele autentica um JID nu contra LDAP sobre HTTP Basic, então não há Keycloak redirecionar para seguir e nenhum controle de logout de aplicativos para clicar; a autenticação do cliente em si passa por portas 5222/5269 e fica fora do loop da Playwright, como observado em Watch Points. `acl.admin` adicionalmente lista apenas o administrador JID, então o administrador da web recusa todas as outras contas diretamente. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declara, por conseguinte, `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona e as afirmações de alcance de linha de base são executadas incondicionalmente."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd ``mod_admin`` UI HTTP é a única superfície testável por Playwright; o login do cliente XMPP em si é executado 5222/5269 e DEVE ser exercido por um XMPP-Conhece o cliente fora do circuito de testes da Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "A única superfície HTTP do ejabberd é ``ejabberd_web_admin`` ligado ``/admin`` (ver ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona e as afirmações de alcance de linha de base são executadas incondicionalmente."

